FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

MIRA
(serious)
Intercepts show the regional command centre is preparing one final offensive. Its archive contains the original deployment orders.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(measured)
The archive is more important than the buildings around it. We need proof, not ruins.

MIRA
(firm)
Secure the data room before the evacuation protocol wipes it. Stop the offensive and recover the records.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
